WithTimeout(short), nothing sent -> i/o timeout
ReadTimeout(short), nothing sent -> i/o timeout
WithTimeout(0), a late write -> 4 bytes
  waited for it: true
ReadTimeout(-1s), a late write -> 5 bytes
WithTimeout(short), input waiting -> 5 bytes
eof: [one] [two] [thr] <EOF> <EOF>
timeout: [one] [two] <i/o timeout> <i/o timeout>
eof: [one] [two] <EOF> <EOF>
timeout: [one] <i/o timeout> <i/o timeout>
eof: [abcd] [wxyz] <EOF> <EOF>
timeout: [abcd] <i/o timeout> <i/o timeout>
eof: [abcd] [wxyz] <EOF> <EOF>
timeout: [abcd] <i/o timeout> <i/o timeout>
